        "x": "Underestimating costs is a big problem when it comes to budgeting for a remodel. Be sure to include all aspects of the remodel that include construction costs, designer fees, permit fees, and add a cushion to cover unknown costs, ideally around 10-20% of your estimated total. It will help master your expectations, and consulting with a knowledgeable contractor should help provide more realistic expectations of costs."
